# === LaTeX build artifacts ===
# Note: If you compile via Overleaf's GitHub sync, these are already
# excluded automatically. This file is mainly for anyone compiling locally
# with pdflatex/latexmk.

## Core auxiliary files
*.aux
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.fls
*.out
*.toc
*.fmt
*.fot
*.cb
*.cb2
.*.lb

## Bibliography (biblatex/biber + bibtex)
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.run.xml
*.bak
*.brf

## Build tool byproducts
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex.gz(busy)
*.pdfsync

## Section/chapter split-compile artifacts (e.g. subfiles)
*.auxlock

## Generated intermediate/preview files
*.dvi
*.xdv
*.ps

## hyperref / navigation
*.brf
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb

## OS/editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp